# The repository root holds the Next.js app; construction-erp/ is a separate
# Odoo project whose front-end is OWL, not React. Its useRef/useService are
# OWL hooks, so React's rules-of-hooks reports hundreds of false positives on
# it. The ERP has its own checks in .github/workflows/construction-erp-ci.yml.
